      "Golf community expertise",
      "Pool area carpet specialists",
      "Active adult community experience",
      "Trusted by Encanterra homeowners"
    ],
    icon: "FaStar"
  },
  {
    name: "Pecan Creek",
    title: "Family-Focused Service for Pecan Creek",
    description: "Pecan Creek families trust us for reliable, family-focused carpet cleaning. We understand the needs of growing families and deliver service that keeps your home healthy, clean, and gentle on kids and pets.",
    highlights: [
      "Family-focused service",
      "Quick response times",
      "Pet-friendly cleaning solutions",
      "No harsh chemicals"
    ],
    icon: "FaCrown"
  },
  {
    name: "San Tan Heights",
    title: "Serving San Tan Heights Communities",
    description: "San Tan Heights residents enjoy beautiful mountain views—and the desert dust that comes with them. We help keep your carpets fresh and clean despite the constant battle with Arizona's desert environment.",
