  },
  {
    question: "Can you maintain new home carpets?",
    answer: "Yes! Many San Tan Valley homes are newer construction with builder-grade carpets. Regular professional cleaning is essential to maintain these carpets and protect your investment. Our <a href=\"/services/carpet-cleaning\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\">Hot Carbonating Extraction</a> process is gentle yet effective, helping extend the life of your new home's carpets."
  },
  {
    question: "Do you serve Encanterra?",
    answer: "Yes! We serve the Encanterra golf community and understand the unique needs of this active adult community. From pool area carpet concerns to maintaining a pristine home environment, our technicians are experienced with Encanterra homes. We also serve nearby communities like <a href=\"/queen-creek\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\">Queen Creek</a> and <a href=\"/gilbert\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\">Gilbert</a>."
  },
  {
    question: "How does dry time work in San Tan Valley's climate?",
    answer: "San Tan Valley's warm, dry desert climate is perfect for our cleaning process! Because we use about 80% less water than traditional steam cleaning, your carpets dry in just 1-2 hours. In San Tan Valley's dry climate, they often dry even faster. This means you can get back to your normal routine the same day."
  },
  {
    question: "Do you serve all San Tan Valley ZIP codes?",
    answer: "Yes! We proudly serve all San Tan Valley ZIP codes: 85140, 85142, 85143, and 85144. Whether you're in Johnson Ranch, Encanterra, Pecan Creek, San Tan Heights, or anywhere in the San Tan Valley area, we provide the same exceptional white-glove service."
  },
  {
    question: "What makes your service different for new homes?",
    answer: "We understand that San Tan Valley has many newer homes with builder-grade carpets. These carpets benefit from our low-moisture process that cleans effectively without over-wetting. We also help remove construction dust that may have settled in during the building process and can treat for allergens that accumulate in new carpet fibers."
  },
  {
    question: "Can you remove pool chlorine residue?",
    answer: "Yes! This is a common concern in San Tan Valley's pool communities. Chlorine and moisture tracked in from pools can discolor and damage carpets over time. Our Hot Carbonating Extraction process effectively removes chlorine residue, water spots, and the musty smell that can develop near pool entry areas."
  },
  {
    question: "Do you offer same-day service in San Tan Valley?",
    answer: "In many cases, yes! We understand that San Tan Valley families have busy schedules. Depending on our technicians' availability in your San Tan Valley neighborhood, we can often accommodate same-day or next-day appointments. Call us at (480) 649-3663 to check availability for your area."
  }
];
---

<Base meta_title={meta_title} description={meta_description} canonical={canonical}>
  <SchemaMarkup type="city" city="San Tan Valley" state="Arizona" postalCodes={["85140", "85142", "85143", "85144"]} faqs={faqs} />

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section
    class="py-24 md:py-32 lg:py-40 relative mb-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 via-white to-accent/5"
  >
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Subtitle -->
        <p
          class="text-accent font-semibold text-lg md:text-xl mb-4 tracking-wide uppercase"
          data-aos="fade-up-sm"
        >
          Carpet Cleaning San Tan Valley, Arizona
        </p>

        <!-- Main Heading -->
        <CustomHeading
          as="h1"
          text="Professional Carpet Cleaning in San Tan Valley, Arizona"
          svgColor="text-primary"
          class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-dark mb-6"
          dataAos="fade-up-sm"
          dataAosDelay="50"
        />

        <!-- Subheading -->
        <p
          class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-text/80 mb-8 font-medium"
          data-aos="fade-up-sm"
          data-aos-delay="100"
        >
          Serving San Tan Valley's Growing Communities
        </p>

        <!-- Trust Badges - San Tan Valley Neighborhoods Focus -->
        <div
          class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto"
          data-aos="fade-up-sm"
          data-aos-delay="150"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-border">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary text-white font-bold text-xl flex-shrink-0">
              🏘️
            </div>
            <div class="text-left">
              <div class="font-bold text-dark text-sm md:text-base">Johnson Ranch</div>
              <div class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-600">Master-Planned</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-border">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary text-white font-bold text-xl flex-shrink-0">
              ⛳
            </div>
            <div class="text-left">
              <div class="font-bold text-dark text-sm md:text-base">Encanterra</div>
              <div class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-600">Golf Community</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-border">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary text-white font-bold text-xl flex-shrink-0">
              🌳
            </div>
            <div class="text-left">
              <div class="font-bold text-dark text-sm md:text-base">Pecan Creek</div>
              <div class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-600">Family Community</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-border">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary text-white font-bold text-xl flex-shrink-0">
              🏔️
            </div>
            <div class="text-left">
              <div class="font-bold text-dark text-sm md:text-base">San Tan Heights</div>
              <div class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-600">Mountain Views</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA Buttons -->
        <div
          class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-4"
          data-aos="fade-up-sm"
          data-aos-delay="200"
        >
          <CustomButton
            link="tel:4806493663"
            label="Call (480) 649-3663"
            variant="primary"
            className="w-full sm:w-auto text-lg px-8 py-4"
            data_track="phone-click"
            data_track_location="hero-san-tan-valley"
          />
          <CustomButton
            link="#contact-form"
            label="Schedule Online"
            variant="secondary"
            className="w-full sm:w-auto text-lg px-8 py-4"
            data_track="cta-click"
            data_track_location="hero-san-tan-valley"
            data_track_action="navigate-appointment"
