        </h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-text/80">
          Circle Cross Ranch • Copper Basin • Ironwood Crossing • Solera • All San Tan Valley ZIP codes
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problem Section - San Tan Valley Challenges -->
  <section class="section bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 via-white to-accent/10">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <CustomHeading
            as="h2"
            text="The Challenge of Living in San Tan Valley"
            svgColor="text-primary"
            class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-dark mb-6"
            dataAos="fade-up-sm"
          />
          <p
            class="text-lg md:text-xl text-text/80"
            data-aos="fade-up-sm"
            data-aos-delay="50"
          >
            San Tan Valley's growing communities create unique challenges for your carpets and home
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div
            class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-lg text-center"
            data-aos="fade-up-sm"
            data-aos-delay="100"
          >
            <div class="text-5xl mb-4">🏗️</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-3">New Construction Dust</h3>
            <p class="text-text/80">
              San Tan Valley's rapid growth means ongoing construction nearby. Builder-grade carpets in new homes need special care, and construction dust settles in carpets throughout the area.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-lg text-center"
            data-aos="fade-up-sm"
            data-aos-delay="150"
          >
            <div class="text-5xl mb-4">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-3">Growing Families</h3>
            <p class="text-text/80">
              San Tan Valley attracts young families with kids and pets. Active households mean more foot traffic, spills, accidents, and wear on carpets that need regular professional cleaning.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-lg text-center"
            data-aos="fade-up-sm"
            data-aos-delay="200"
          >
            <div class="text-5xl mb-4">🏊</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-3">Pool Communities</h3>
            <p class="text-text/80">
              Many San Tan Valley homes have pools or community pools. Chlorine, moisture, and wet feet constantly being tracked inside leads to carpet discoloration and musty odors.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Solution Section - Perfect for San Tan Valley -->
  <section class="section bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <p
            class="text-accent font-semibold text-sm md:text-base mb-3 tracking-wider uppercase"
            data-aos="fade-up-sm"
          >
            The Perfect Solution
          </p>
          <CustomHeading
            as="h2"
            text="Hot Carbonating Extraction: Ideal for Growing Families"
            svgColor="text-accent"
            class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-dark mb-6"
            dataAos="fade-up-sm"
            dataAosDelay="50"
          />
