            class="text-lg md:text-xl text-text/80"
            data-aos="fade-up-sm"
            data-aos-delay="100"
          >
            Our unique cleaning process is perfectly matched to San Tan Valley's active family lifestyle
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
          <div
            class="bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 to-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-border"
            data-aos="fade-right-sm"
          >
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">💧</span>
              Lightning-Fast Drying
            </h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-text/80 mb-4">
              Uses about 80% less water than traditional steam cleaning. Combined with San Tan Valley's dry climate, your carpets dry in just <strong>1-2 hours</strong> instead of 1-2 days.
            </p>
            <p class="text-text/70">
              Perfect for busy San Tan Valley families who need to get back to normal life quickly—no humidity, no dampness, no waiting.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/5 to-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-border"
            data-aos="fade-left-sm"
          >
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">🫧</span>
              Deep Cleaning Power
            </h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-text/80 mb-4">
              Millions of carbonating bubbles penetrate deep into carpet fibers, lifting embedded dirt, stains from kids and pets, and allergens to the surface where they're extracted.
            </p>
            <p class="text-text/70">
              More effective than steam cleaning at removing the stubborn stains and ground-in dirt that active San Tan Valley families deal with daily.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 to-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-border"
            data-aos="fade-right-sm"
            data-aos-delay="50"
          >
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">🌿</span>
              No Harsh Chemicals
            </h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-text/80 mb-4">
              You can feel good knowing The Natural® contains no harsh chemicals — <strong>gentle on children and pets</strong>. Critical for San Tan Valley's family-oriented communities.
            </p>
            <p class="text-text/70">
              Your kids and pets can play on freshly cleaned carpets as soon as they're dry—usually in just 1-2 hours.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/5 to-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-border"
            data-aos="fade-left-sm"
            data-aos-delay="50"
          >
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">🚫</span>
              No Sticky Residue
            </h3>
            <p class="text-lg text-text/80 mb-4">
              Unlike steam cleaning that leaves soapy residue, our carbonating process uses no soaps or harsh chemicals. No dirt-attracting residue means carpets stay cleaner longer.
            </p>
            <p class="text-text/70">
              With kids and pets constantly on the carpet, the last thing you need is residue that attracts more dirt—your carpets stay cleaner longer.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Benefits Summary -->
        <div
          class="bg-dark text-white rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 text-center"
          data-aos="fade-up-sm"
        >
          <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-6">
            Why San Tan Valley Families Choose Our Method
          </h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-left md:text-center">
            <div>
              <div class="text-4xl mb-3">⚡</div>
              <div class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Dries in 1-2 Hours</div>
              <div class="text-white/80 text-sm">Perfect for busy families</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-4xl mb-3">👶</div>
              <div class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">No Harsh Chemicals</div>
              <div class="text-white/80 text-sm">Gentle on your family</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-4xl mb-3">🌱</div>
              <div class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">No Soaps or Fragrances</div>
              <div class="text-white/80 text-sm">Peace of mind for families</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services Throughout San Tan Valley -->
  <section class="section bg-light">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
